Weather for Mumbai: Sunny


-------------------------


Example 4: Menu Agent


menu = {
    "pizza": 300,
    "burger": 150,
    "pasta": 250
}

item = input("Enter Item: ").lower()

if item in menu:
    print("Price =", menu[item])
else:
    print("Item not available")


Output:

Enter Item: pizza

Price = 300

-------------------



