Example 6: Memory Agent


memory = {}

name = input("Enter Your Name: ")

memory["name"] = name

print("Welcome", memory["name"])


Output:


Enter Your Name: Hyarel

Welcome Hyarel


-------------------------------



Beginner AI Agent Project Structure


ai-agent/
│
├── main.py
├── tools.py
└── memory.py



tools.py

def calculator(a, b):
    return a + b


memory.py

memory = {}


main.py

from tools import calculator
from memory import memory

memory["user"] = "Hyarel"

result = calculator(10, 20)

print("User:", memory["user"])
print("Result:", result)


Run:	

python main.py


Output:


User: Hyarel
Result: 30

